
========== 0. 環境 ==========
$ wasmtime --version
wasmtime 49.0.1 (46c23a87d 2026-09-24)
[exit 0]
$ wat2wasm --version
1.0.34
[exit 0]
$ node --version
v18.19.1
[exit 0]

========== 1. 41バイトの計算機（WAT を手で書いて動かす） ==========
$ cat add.wat
(module
  (func (export "add") (param i32 i32) (result i32)
    local.get 0
    local.get 1
    i32.add))
[exit 0]
$ wat2wasm add.wat -o add.wasm
[exit 0]
$ ls -l add.wasm
-rw-r--r-- 1 lab lab 41 Sep 30 19:11 add.wasm
[exit 0]
$ xxd add.wasm
00000000: 0061 736d 0100 0000 0107 0160 027f 7f01  .asm.......`....
00000010: 7f03 0201 0007 0701 0361 6464 0000 0a09  .........add....
00000020: 0107 0020 0020 016a 0b                   ... . .j.
[exit 0]
$ wasmtime run --invoke add add.wasm 3 4
warning: using `--invoke` with a function that takes arguments is experimental and may break in the future
warning: using `--invoke` with a function that returns values is experimental and may break in the future
7
[exit 0]
--- WASM の型に文字列は無い。(result i32) を文字列にしようとすると？ ---
$ wat2wasm str.wat -o str.wasm
str.wat:2:34: error: unexpected token string, expected ).
  (func (export "greet") (result string)
                                 ^^^^^^
[exit 1]

========== 2. 能力は import でしか増えない ==========
$ cat imp.wat
(module
  (import "env" "log" (func $log (param i32)))
  (func (export "run")
    i32.const 42
    call $log))
[exit 0]
$ wat2wasm imp.wat -o imp.wasm
[exit 0]
--- wasmtime は env.log を持っていない ---
$ wasmtime run --invoke run imp.wasm
Error: failed to run main module `imp.wasm`

Caused by:
    0: failed to instantiate "imp.wasm"
    1: unknown import: `env::log` has not been defined

[exit 1]
--- Node から import を渡すと動くか ---
$ node host_ok.mjs
ホストが受け取った値: 42
[exit 0]
--- import を1つ削ると何が起きるか ---
$ node host_ng.mjs
LinkError: WebAssembly.instantiate(): Import #0 module="env" function="log" error: function import requires a callable
[exit 0]

========== 3. 境界を越えられるのは数値だけ（文字列は ptr と len の約束） ==========
$ cat mem.wat
(module
  (memory (export "mem") 1)
  (data (i32.const 0) "hello wasm")
  (func (export "ptr") (result i32) i32.const 0)
  (func (export "len") (result i32) i32.const 10))
[exit 0]
$ wat2wasm mem.wat -o mem.wasm
[exit 0]
--- 数値しか返らないことを確認する ---
$ wasmtime run --invoke ptr mem.wasm
warning: using `--invoke` with a function that returns values is experimental and may break in the future
0
[exit 0]
$ wasmtime run --invoke len mem.wasm
warning: using `--invoke` with a function that returns values is experimental and may break in the future
10
[exit 0]
--- ホスト側で ptr と len を使って文字列に組み立てる ---
$ node readstr.mjs
ptr = 0  len = 10
組み立てた文字列 = hello wasm
線形メモリの実体 = ArrayBuffer 65536 バイト
[exit 0]

========== 4. 同じ .wasm が、ホストが違うと動かない ==========
$ wat2wasm wasi.wat -o wasi.wasm
[exit 0]
--- wasmtime は WASI を持っている ---
$ wasmtime run wasi.wasm
hello from wasi
[exit 0]
--- ブラウザ相当（素の Node）は WASI を持っていない ---
$ node wasi_browser.mjs
TypeError: WebAssembly.instantiate(): Import #0 module="wasi_snapshot_preview1" error: module is not an object or function
[exit 0]
--- 逆に、ブラウザ用の .wasm を wasmtime に渡すと？ ---
$ wasmtime run mem.wasm
[exit 0]

